#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_editor.md:1
msgid "Key Editor"
msgstr "キーエディター"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_editor.md:3
msgid "Edit key appearance and functionality in the key editor."
msgstr "キーエディターで、キーの見た目と機能を編集します。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_editor.md:5
msgid "![1742262722603](image/getting_started/1742262722603.png)"
msgstr "![1742262722603](image/getting_started/1742262722603.png)"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_editor.md:5
msgid "1742262722603"
msgstr "1742262722603"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_editor.md:7
msgid "Feature descriptions:"
msgstr "機能の説明:"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_editor.md:9
msgid "Key title"
msgstr "キータイトル"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_editor.md:10
msgid "Key function description"
msgstr "キー機能の説明"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_editor.md:11
msgid "Confirm changes"
msgstr "変更を確定"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_editor.md:12
msgid "Apply current key's appearance settings to other keys"
msgstr "現在のキーの外観設定を他のキーに適用する"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_editor.md:13
msgid "Create a duplicate of current key"
msgstr "現在のキーの複製を作成します"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_editor.md:14
msgid "Discard all changes"
msgstr "すべての変更を破棄する"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_editor.md:15
msgid "Delete current key"
msgstr "現在のキーを削除します"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_editor.md:16
msgid "Key edit preview"
msgstr "キー編集プレビュー"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_editor.md:17
msgid ""
"Switch to key background editing interface. For detailed information, see "
"[Background Editing Interface](./background.md)"
msgstr ""
"キーの背景編集画面に切り替えます。詳細は "
"[背景の編集画面](./background.md) を参照してください。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_editor.md:18
msgid ""
"Switch to key foreground editing interface. For detailed information, see "
"[Foreground Editing Interface](./foreground.md)"
msgstr ""
"キーの前景編集画面に切り替えます。詳細は "
"[前景の編集画面](./foreground.md) を参照してください。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_editor.md:19
msgid ""
"Switch to key function editing interface. This interface varies according to"
" key function. See [Key Function Documentation](../functions/index.rst)"
msgstr ""
"キー機能の編集画面に切り替えます。表示内容はキー機能により異なります。"
" 詳細は [キー機能のドキュメント](../functions/index.rst) を参照してください。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_editor.md:20
msgid ""
"Switch to key general function editing interface, such as long-press trigger"
" settings"
msgstr ""
"長押しトリガー設定など、キー共通の機能を編集する画面に"
"切り替えます。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_editor.md:22
msgid ""
"In interface ④ for applying appearance settings to other keys, you can "
"select specific appearance settings to apply and the application scope."
msgstr ""
"④の「外観を他のキーに適用」では、反映する外観の項目と"
"適用範囲を選べます。"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_editor.md:24
msgid "![1742285928034](image/getting_started/1742285928034.png)"
msgstr "![1742285928034](image/getting_started/1742285928034.png)"

