#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_editor.md:26
msgid "Next Steps"
msgstr "次のステップ"

#: ../../source/flexdesigner/key_editor.md:28
msgid ""
"Visit the [Background](background.md) and [Foreground](foreground.md) to "
"learn how to customize a key"
msgstr ""
"キーの見た目の調整方法は、[背景の編集](background.md)および[前景の編集](foreground.md)を参照してください。"
